            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.32

- Hides unhydrated completed and unread thread placeholders from the notch menu until their project and title metadata is available.
- Prevents metadata-less placeholder threads from switching the notch status to Unread before they can be shown as real project threads.
